# Secrets come from .rest/mayar/.env (gitignored): MAYAR_API_KEY, MAYAR_WEBHOOK_TOKEN.
# Sandbox: https://api.mayar.io/hl/v2 · Prod: https://api.mayar.id/hl/v2
@mayarBase = https://api.mayar.io/hl/v2
@mayarToken = {{$dotenv MAYAR_API_KEY}}

### Register webhook URL (use Tailscale funnel / ngrok during dev)
POST {{mayarBase}}/webhooks/update
Authorization: Bearer {{mayarToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "urlHook": "https://jordans-mac-mini.tail7d99a4.ts.net/api/v1/payments/mayar/webhook/"
}

### Webhook delivery history (current store; responsePayload shows our reply)
GET {{mayarBase}}/webhooks/new-history?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{mayarToken}}

### Trigger test webhook
POST {{mayarBase}}/webhooks/test
Authorization: Bearer {{mayarToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "urlHook": "https://jordans-mac-mini.tail7d99a4.ts.net/api/v1/payments/mayar/webhook/"
}
